README Structure
Project Title: Clearly state the project name.
Description: Explain what the project does and its purpose.
Features: List the key functionalities of the system.
Technologies Used: Mention the tech stack (PHP, MySQL, Bootstrap, etc.).
Installation: Provide step-by-step instructions to set up the project locally.
Usage: Describe how to use the application (e.g., admin login, adding students, etc.).
Database Setup: Explain the database schema and how to configure it.
File Structure: Briefly describe the key files and their purposes.
Contributing: Guide others on how to contribute to the project.
License: Specify the license for the project.
